  "rationale": [
    "The owner requested all selected compatible installed models be offered without manually changing the loaded model. This extends the same fixed objective twelve-case gate to each exact public catalog package.",
    "Every provider/model must independently pass all twelve fresh signed network answers within the unchanged thirty-second per-case deadline. Adding a policy never creates or renews an eligibility record.",
    "The existing Smart policy is preserved byte-for-byte as an object to retain its review/evidence identity. Other policies commit this criteria review, not a fabricated measured model observation.",
    "Tokenizers and rendered candidate prompts have independent native vocabulary reference checks. Those checks do not establish loaded model quality, performance, or prior qualification.",
    "Reward weights continue the existing square-root formula using nominal package model sizes. Free-credit budgets, eligibility list, tariffs, daily emissions, payout ownership and financial ceilings are unchanged.",
    "On-demand models become requestable only with exact selected package pins, individual fresh qualification and fresh signed device readiness. Capacity rewards still count only the actually loaded model."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No measurements, passing scores, runtime identity attestations or provider eligibility are asserted for unmeasured models.",
    "The public twelve-case suite is a provisional operator gate and can be memorized. It is not Byzantine proof or broad model/security certification.",
    "A model that fails or times out remains unavailable and retries automatically. Larger or reasoning models may not satisfy the unchanged exact-answer/deadline gate.",
    "Native inference speed and physical Pi behavior require actual hardware testing. No financial transfer or reward pool funding is performed by this review."
  ]
}
